2> Detecting: [PREFIX]/share/sourcemeta/one/self/v1/schemas/mcp/tools/call/get-schema-health/response.json (#14)
2> Detecting: [PREFIX]/share/sourcemeta/one/self/v1/schemas/mcp/tools/call/get-schema-positions/request.json (#15)
